# dokploy_servers (Data Source)

Fetches all servers from Dokploy. Use this data source to discover server IDs for importing existing resources.

## Example Usage

```hcl
data "dokploy_servers" "all" {}

# Output all server IDs for import discovery
output "server_ids" {
  value = { for s in data.dokploy_servers.all.servers : s.name => s.id }
}
```

